            "readme_said": "presenterm --export-html <file> (no terminal requirements mentioned)",
            "actually_needed": "Exporting needs a real terminal: without a tty it fails with 'Not a tty (os error 25)', and under a bare `script` pty it hangs waiting for replies to terminal capability queries (kitty graphics, DA1, cursor position). A small Python pty driver that answers those queries made it work. --image-protoc…",
